  "description": "Channel rugged frontier grit, old-school saloon charm, and timeless Wild West heritage with VINTAGE WESTERN! Designed as a distressed slab serif display font, its bold, heavy character forms feature classic bracketed serifs combined with weathered woodblock textures and distressed cuts that give every word an authentic aged look.\nIdeal for cowboy-themed party invitations, rodeo event posters, craft whiskey and beer labeling, vintage apparel branding, country music festival flyers, saloon signage, and custom Cricut or Silhouette vinyl craft projects, VINTAGE WESTERN brings bold frontier character to every headline!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Channel rugged frontier grit, old-school saloon charm, and timeless Wild West heritage with VINTAGE WESTERN! Designed as a distressed slab serif display font, its bold, heavy character forms feature classic bracketed serifs combined with weathered woodblock textures and distressed cuts that give every word an authentic aged look.</p>\n<p>Ideal for cowboy-themed party invitations, rodeo event posters, craft whiskey and beer labeling, vintage apparel branding, country music festival flyers, saloon signage, and custom Cricut or Silhouette vinyl craft projects, VINTAGE WESTERN brings bold frontier character to every headline!</p>",
